OpenCode 通过 `reasoningEffort` 和 variant 设置思考强度。你当前的 [opencode.jsonc](/home/debian19y/.config/opencode/opencode.jsonc) 已配置两档：

```jsonc
"options": {
  "reasoningEffort": "high"
},
"variants": {
  "high": {
    "reasoningEffort": "high"
  },
  "fast": {
    "reasoningEffort": "low"
  }
}
```

然后按代理选择档位：

```jsonc
"agent": {
  "build":   { "model": "krill/grok-4.5", "variant": "high" },
  "general": { "model": "krill/grok-4.5", "variant": "high" },
  "title":   { "model": "krill/grok-4.5", "variant": "fast" },
  "explore": { "model": "krill/grok-4.5", "variant": "fast" }
}
```

临时指定强度：

```bash
opencode run --variant high "处理这个任务"
opencode run --variant fast "快速分析"
```

常见强度值有 `low`、`medium`、`high`；`xhigh` 是否有效取决于模型服务。Krill 的 `grok-4.5` 当前已验证 `high` 能正常调用。

注意：`--thinking` 只是显示思考内容，不会提高思考强度。之前的 `thinking.budgetTokens` 是 Anthropic 风格，对当前 OpenAI-compatible Provider 不合适。
